Package: PoBatch
Version: 0.0.0
Section: base
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.28), libgtk2.0-0 (>= 2.24)
Maintainer: Alexander Tverskoy <astverskoy@gmail.com>
Description: PoBatch is an easy-to-use PO file editor for l10n workflows. It displays source strings and translations in a grid, allowing selection of columns or rows and bulk copy and paste operations. This makes it easy to quickly update translations within a PO file.
